{
  "info": {
    "name": "Altec Totem Mock API (Code-based)",
    "description": "Colecao gerada a partir da implementacao real em src/routes e middlewares.\n\nCredenciais e acesso:\n- Header (auth padrao): Authorization: ApiKey {{apiKey}}\n- API keys conhecidas:\n  - {{apiKey}} = ksk_mock_altec_001 (tenant tnt_altec)\n  - {{apiKeyAlt}} = ksk_mock_altec_002 (tenant tnt_altec)\n  - {{wildcardApiKey}} = ksk_mock_wildcard_001 (acesso wildcard para tenant em endpoints suportados)\n- Bootstrap (publico): nao exige Authorization\n- Codigo de ativacao valido para bootstrap: {{activationCode}}\n\nObservacoes:\n- Endpoints presentes no codigo atual: /config, /kiosks/bootstrap, /catalog, /orderUpdate, /orders/{orderId}, /ws/emit e / (root).\n- WebSocket disponivel em: ws://127.0.0.1:10099/v1/ws?api_key={{apiKey}}",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "Authorization",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "ApiKey {{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseOrigin",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:10099"
    },
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:10099/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "ksk_mock_altec_001"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKeyAlt",
      "value": "ksk_mock_altec_002"
    },
    {
      "key": "wildcardApiKey",
      "value": "ksk_mock_wildcard_001"
    },
    {
      "key": "tenantId",
      "value": "tnt_altec"
    },
    {
      "key": "establishmentId",
      "value": "est_sp_centro"
    },
    {
      "key": "kioskId",
      "value": "kio_009"
    },
    {
      "key": "activationCode",
      "value": "ACT-8812-XXQZ"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": "order-test-001"
    },
    {
      "key": "ifNoneMatch",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "wsUrl",
      "value": "ws://127.0.0.1:10099/v1/ws?api_key={{apiKey}}"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Root",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseOrigin}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{baseOrigin}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint de informacoes gerais da API."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Config",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /tenants/:tenantId/establishments/:establishmentId/kiosks/:kioskId/config",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/establishments/{{establishmentId}}/kiosks/{{kioskId}}/config",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tenants",
                "{{tenantId}}",
                "establishments",
                "{{establishmentId}}",
                "kiosks",
                "{{kioskId}}",
                "config"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /config com include e locale",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/establishments/{{establishmentId}}/kiosks/{{kioskId}}/config?include=branding,payment_methods&locale=pt-BR",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tenants",
                "{{tenantId}}",
                "establishments",
                "{{establishmentId}}",
                "kiosks",
                "{{kioskId}}",
                "config"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "include",
                  "value": "branding,payment_methods"
                },
                {
                  "key": "locale",
                  "value": "pt-BR"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /config com If-None-Match",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "If-None-Match",
                "value": "{{ifNoneMatch}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/establishments/{{establishmentId}}/kiosks/{{kioskId}}/config",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tenants",
                "{{tenantId}}",
                "establishments",
                "{{establishmentId}}",
                "kiosks",
                "{{kioskId}}",
                "config"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
